WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Dialogue.

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.400
Quotation marks go around the exact words.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.280
The comma or the end mark goes inside the closing quotation mark.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.450
Then the tag:

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.100
said Trumpkin, cried Edmund.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.050
A fast shout can be just a fragment.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.670
The marks around it still follow the rules.
